    <string name="settings_lab">Fold Lab</string>
    <string name="settings_lab_body">Engine events and fold timing, for the device test of the Fold7.</string>
    <string name="settings_limits">Known limitations</string>
    <string name="settings_limits_body">• The motion is the wallpaper\'s own. It cannot control Samsung\'s screen switch animation or the lock screen animation.\n• If the new screen appears more than 3 seconds after folding (for example inside another app), the end state is shown without motion.\n• One UI may keep separate wallpapers for the cover and main screens. Fold Lab records how this phone behaves.\n• Packs are drawn by an on-device illustrator, not an AI model. Cloud generation and the community gallery are not part of this version.</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">No account, no internet permission, no analytics. Descriptions are used only while generating; the pack keeps a hash, not the text. Packs stay on this phone unless you share them.</string>
